      "writtenOn": "2025-05-29T05:19:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think callers of this method need to be holding the lock to be safe (otherwise they could race with MapAsync or Destroy). I\u0027m assume this was safe before because of the device autolock, but if it was never safe then this isn\u0027t a blocker.",
      "revId": "6b7b404cef798f7d3c8ef920d08b224549873532",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "6de7680b_f757d01e",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/Buffer.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 19
      },
      "lineNbr": 604,
      "author": {
        "id": 1002831
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-05-29T20:55:46Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is still protected by the device autolock since it gets called in either `WriteBuffer` or `Submit`. But from what I can tell, this wouldn\u0027t be safe either way unless we locked the entire buffer for the duration of the `WriteBuffer` or `Submit` call?\n\nMaybe we should do that? (But probably would need to be a follow up change.)",
      "parentUuid": "364e2261_8791a46e",
      "revId": "6b7b404cef798f7d3c8ef920d08b224549873532",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "c7cf99a0_6a9719cc",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/Buffer.cpp",
