      },
      "lineNbr": 801,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000014
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-05-29T05:19:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What lock must be held while calling this? Right now, we hold the device lock, not the SynchronizedState lock. I\u0027m not sure that\u0027s safe? Probably we actually need to pass a `Usage` in here like I think you had before. Or if not, we need to comment on this function (in the header) about what lock must be held while calling it.\n\nSimilar questions about every other function that was previously assuming the device lock was held.",
      "revId": "6b7b404cef798f7d3c8ef920d08b224549873532",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
